  "notes": "Symptoms. Left ankle soreness began after twisting the left ankle yesterday. Pertinent negatives. Denies fever, numbness, and right ankle pain. Pain score, six out of 10. Pain score correction three out of 10. The earlier six out of ten one entered in error. Examination mild swelling over the left lateral ankle. No open wound. Assessment. The clinician explicitly documents a left ankle strain. Plan. The clinician explicitly directs rest, eyes wrapped in cloth for fifteen minutes at a time, and follow-up in three days. No medication is prescribed.",
